 "content": {
  "text": "and\nerner and I came to Brazil in 1937 by\nhelp of a cousin of mine by my fathers side.\nⵙⴶⵔ\nToday as one estimates are about 1s.000 few\nliving in Rio from all over the world. Our\ncomunity was originally founded for german\nEmigrant But nowday we are of all dessents, and\nbecause the \"JeMes\" are naturally disappearing,\nOur community belongs to the world know\nfor progressive Judaism. And we are 700\npaying families. In the whole there are\n130.000 Jews (more or less) in Pragie.\nThank you so much, for\nYedith\nDeas\nyour interest for deborah, and she likes you\nGilleon\nvery much. Her mother Jeanette, has the\ngood intention to write you. She is always\nbusry, and something always is only for\nvery\ntomorrow.\nI wish you all the best, principally for\nNow\nyour youngest son, and we all hope for\npeace. Love for you, Gideon and the\nyour\nwhole family.\nLove and best wishes for all of you\nWerne\nList\nincl\nfamily as I know\n①\n(epy)\nAufbau of Sept. 1963\nof Baal Schem, printed in the jornal\nletter\nCommity in Frankfurt/M. of the 1930\npage of the Encielopedia Judaica",
